    <title lang="en">Space Jam: A New Legacy</title>
    <desc lang="en">Superstar LeBron James and his young son, Dom, get trapped in digital space by a rogue AI. To get home safely, LeBron teams up with Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck and the rest of the Looney Tunes gang for a high-stakes basketball game against the AI's digitized champions of the court -- a powered-up roster called the Goon Squad.</desc>
    <credits>
      <actor>LeBron James</actor>
