    <title lang="fr">Past Hunters</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Bulkeley Hotel</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">The former home of Queen Victoria is now home to many spirits who have been seen by guests and staff. Witness the first ever formal documentation of the paranormal activities in the Bulkeley Hotel.</desc>
