<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261115175500 +0000" stop="20261115182000 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Quirky Science</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Waves</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Radio waves, born from electromagnetism, power wireless tech like phones, TVs, and RADAR. Though invisible, they've transformed society. Discoveries by Galvani, Franklin, and Oersted revealed their power. From melting chocolate to X-rays, EM waves penetrate everything—even the human body. Now, they're helping us explore the brain. What's next for this invisible force?</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire scientifique</category>
