    <title>Made in Britain S1 - "Wensleydale Cheese and Mowbray Pork Pies"</title>
    <desc>At the Wensleydale Creamery, Lord Prescott joins master cheesemakers to follow the production of the famous Yorkshire Wensleydale cheese, learning the art of cheese-tasting along the way. His next stop is Mowbray Pork Pies, where he experiences the high-speed world of pie production.</desc>
  </programme>
  
