    <title>Made in Britain S1 - "Lea and Perrins Worcestershire Sauce and Soreen's Malt Loaf"</title>
    <desc>Exploring the historic Lea &amp; Perrins factory, Lord Prescott uncovers the story behind its legendary Worcestershire sauce, made since 1837. He then heads to Manchester to the Soreen factory, home of the beloved malt loaf, where he joins the production line and experiments with creating a new flavour.</desc>
  </programme>
  
