    <title>Made in Britain S1 - "Ambrosia's desserts and Young's battered fish"</title>
    <desc>To discover how his favourite meal—fish supper followed by rice pudding—is made, Lord Prescott visits the Ambrosia factory in Devon to explore the production of classic British desserts. Returning north to Grimsby, he heads to the Young's factory to learn about their famous fish pie.</desc>
  </programme>
  
