    <title>Keepers Of The Cape - The Issues S1 - "Responsible Fishing"</title>
    <desc>In this episode we look at the WWF Responsible Fisheries Programme. Dr. Samantha Petersen, the programme manager, tells exactly us what this entails and Tali dons her waterproofs and sets sail where she chats to fishermen and others in the industry.</desc>
  </programme>
  
