    <title>Keepers Of The Cape - The Issues S1 - "West Coast Marine Protected Area"</title>
    <desc>In this episode we show just how valuable this marine protected area is.Tali meets up with a group of scientists who are doing various studies so that they can assess the fish stocks and look at what role the mpa has in managing these stocks.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261115135811 +0000" stop="20261115142738 +0000">
    <title>Keepers Of The Cape - The Issues S1 - "De Hoop Marine Protected Area"</title>
    <desc>In this episode Tali explores the various creatures that reside in De Hoop Marine Protected Area, from the Greater White Pelicans and Chacma baboons to the large Eland.</desc>
  </programme>
  
